{
  "title": "Helix - Get Header Analysis",
  "tags": ["helix", "proposer", "get_header"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
      "from": "now-5m",
      "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
        {
          "name": "datasource",
          "label": "Prometheus",
          "type": "datasource",
          "query": "prometheus"
        },
        {
          "name": "namespace",
          "label": "Namespace",
          "type": "constant",
          "current": {
            "value": "relay-helix",
            "text": "relay-helix"
          },
          "hide": 2
        }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "Get Header Requests per Slot (12s windows)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(helix_request_status_total{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\"}[12s]))",
            "legendFormat": "Requests/slot",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Number of get_header requests per 12-second slot window",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "bars",
              "barAlignment": -1
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "Get Header Success Rate",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(helix_request_status_total{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\", http_status_code=\"200\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(helix_request_status_total{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 100",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percent",
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {"value": null, "color": "red"},
                {"value": 70, "color": "yellow"},
                {"value": 90, "color": "green"}
              ]
            },
            "decimals": 1
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "No Bid Prepared Rate",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(rate(helix_request_status_total{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\", http_status_code=\"204\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(helix_request_status_total{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 100",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Percentage of requests that received 204 No Content (no bid available)",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "percent",
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {"value": null, "color": "green"},
                {"value": 10, "color": "yellow"},
                {"value": 30, "color": "red"}
              ]
            },
            "decimals": 1
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "Get Header Latency Distribution",
        "type": "heatmap",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum(increase(helix_request_latency_secs_bucket{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le)",
            "format": "heatmap",
            "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "options": {
          "calculate": true,
          "calculation": {
            "xBuckets": {
              "mode": "size",
              "value": "30s"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "scheme",
            "scheme": "Spectral"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "title": "Bid Signing Latency (p95, p99)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(helix_bid_signing_latency_us_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le)) / 1000",
            "legendFormat": "p95",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          },
          {
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(helix_bid_signing_latency_us_bucket[$__rate_interval])) by (le)) / 1000",
            "legendFormat": "p99",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Time spent re-signing bids for get_header responses",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "ms",
            "custom": {
              "lineWidth": 2
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "title": "Get Header Timeouts",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "rate(helix_header_timeout_fetch[$__rate_interval])",
            "legendFormat": "Fetch Timeout",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          },
          {
            "expr": "rate(helix_header_timeout_sleep[$__rate_interval])",
            "legendFormat": "Sleep Timeout",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "ops",
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "bars"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "title": "Get Header by Status Code",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16},
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "sum by (http_status_code) (rate(helix_request_status_total{exported_endpoint=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
            "legendFormat": "{{http_status_code}}",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${datasource}"
            }
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "reqps",
            "custom": {
              "fillOpacity": 10,
              "stacking": {
                "mode": "normal"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "title": "🔖 BACKLOG: Get Header Requests by IP",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22},
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "**Future Enhancement**: Track get_header requests by IP address\n\nRequires correlation of Envoy access logs with trace IDs (x-request-id)\n\n**Implementation Plan**:\n1. Configure Envoy to log `x-request-id` + client IP to structured logs\n2. Create Loki query: `{namespace=\"relay-helix\", job=\"envoy\", route=~\"/eth/v1/builder/header.*\"} | json | unwrap client_ip`\n3. Join with Helix traces on request_id field\n\nExample Envoy log format needed:\n```json\n{\"timestamp\":\"...\", \"request_id\":\"uuid\", \"client_ip\":\"1.2.3.4\", \"route\":\"/eth/v1/builder/header/...\"}\n```"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
